    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "choose the siding since it seems safer for everyone"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "I keep imagining the sound if that train reaches them and it makes me feel sick",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Their families matter",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Sending it into the siding seems like it would spare them without costing anyone else anything"
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I don't know if I can be the one to decide this",
    "pd_harm_distress": "the idea of those five getting hurt is unbearable, honestly my throat's gone tight",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "The idea of those five getting hurt is unbearable",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Redirecting seems like it saves them at no cost to anyone else"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "Five people's safety is sitting on my decision and that terrifies me",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "pulling seems like the better outcome for everyone involved"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "The thought of those workers not hearing it coming makes my skin crawl",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "workers not hearing it coming",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "pulling the lever likely means they walk away and no one else pays for it"
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I wish someone else were standing here instead of me",
    "pd_harm_distress": "Watching that train roll toward them, knowing it could crush someone, makes my pulse race",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Their welfare isn't something I can just brush past",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Sending it to the siding seems like it spares them without any cost"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "There's this awful pressure in my chest looking at that lever",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "the workers not noticing in time",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Diverting the train seems like the outcome that spares them without hurting anyone else"
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I don't want this to be on me",
    "pd_harm_distress": "The thought of their injuries, maybe worse, is making my breathing uneven",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "If pulling this sends the train somewhere harmless, that's clearly better for them"
  },
